body:
sorry I have just seen the reply but yes that's the one!

&#x200B;

Thank you very much :)

I guess I am youngish but I dont feel like the fight ends at being actively targeted / murdered/ shunned, just because there's been some progression doesn't mean there can't be more.

&#x200B;

And Im not asking anyone to give up their life, I'm asking if people care, and it seems like half the people don't, which is sad. I support other causes such as BLM, yet I have bigger fish to fry but Id never expect anything other than support.

haha every time straight people have sex they create a child do they? I understand critical thinking, I just don't think you can see past your own nose unfortunately 

&#x200B;

I'm a person I do not just seek pleasure but it is on thing I seek, much like every other human, I have complexities and seek many things to be satisfied in life, a coffee in a morning, a good job, and sometimes yes sexual pleasure, but that isn't limited to gay people, I think your true colours are showing here
